<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: New Irish car licensings rise to 13,545 in March.</title>
<headline>New Irish car licensings rise to 13,545 in March.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new private cars licensed in Ireland rose/fell to 13,545 in March from 12,982 in February, provisional Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showirled on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Licensings were up from March 1996 when they totalled 13,479.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
